'''Gendo & Fuyutsuki Cats''' are a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be obtained as a [[Daily Bonus|Stamp Reward]] on the 5th day of the [[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event]]. They were added in [[Version 6.10 Update|Version 6.10]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 403
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Gendo & Fuyutsuki Cats
|name2 = Moon Gendo & Fuyutsuki Cats
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Moon Gendo & Fuyutsuki Cats''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Due to Gendo & Fuyutsuki Cats' weak attack power and health, they won't be good for much other than new players. However, their short cooldown and low cost makes them a decent cat to use as a meatshield, mainly in [[Empire of Cats]] or early 4-crown stages in [[Stories of Legend]].

Overall, Gendo & Fuyutsuki Cats are very similar to [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cat]], but trade attack speed with attack power.

{{Job|Classification = Meatshield}}

